# build output and local caches
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/artifacts/
__pycache__/
.dotnet/
.nuget/
.runtime/
*.tmp
*.garden
*.map
Map.lnk

# The public repository holds the app, its climate model (worldclimate v1) and the checks;
# the research history (other engines, experiments, literature, notes) stays in the local folder only.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md
/climate-test.ps1
/Start-Climate-Test.cmd
/docs/*
!/docs/package-readme.txt
!/docs/package-third-party.txt
/tests/*
!/tests/TheGarden.Checks/
!/tests/TheGarden.DesktopChecks/
/tools/climate/*
!/tools/climate/worldclimate/
!/tools/climate/vector_terrain.py
!/tools/climate/engine/
/tools/climate/engine/*
!/tools/climate/engine/__init__.py
!/tools/climate/engine/profile.py
!/tools/climate/engine/astronomy.py
